      "text": [
        "454 - وَقَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «مَنْ أَخَذَ بِجَوَانِبِ اَلسَّرِيرِ اَلْأَرْبَعَةِ غَفَرَ اَللَّهُ لَهُ أَرْبَعِينَ كَبِيرَةً."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.454 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"Whoever takes hold of the four sides of the bier (funeral bier) will have forty major sins forgiven by Allah (swt).\""
        ]
      }
